        editorPosition: {x: -289.66125, y: 5.830007}
        speakerId: Player (calm)
        text: "I\u2019ve talked with both of you. Shall we try a different way? This
          time, say what you need, without starting from what the other does wrong.
          And think about what you could actually ask of each other."
        localizedText:
          m_TableReference:
            m_TableCollectionName: GUID:f8fabd72a30bffb479f5f15b97ffd357
